        "hanzi": "你怎么在这儿站着？",
        "pinyin": "Nǐ zěnme zài zhèr zhànzhe?"
      },
      {
        "hanzi": "今天下午你不是有约会吗？",
        "pinyin": "Jīntiān xiàwǔ nǐ bú shì yǒu yuēhuì ma?"
      },
      {
        "hanzi": "她会穿着一件白衬衫。",
        "pinyin": "Tā huì chuānzhe yī jiàn bái chènshān."
      },
      {
        "hanzi": "他手中拿着一本《汽车》杂志。",
        "pinyin": "Tā shǒu zhōng názhe yī běn 《Qìchē》 zázhì."
      }
    ],
    "grammarPoints": [
      {
        "zh": "反问句“不是……吗？”",
        "en": "The rhetorical question using “不是……吗？”"
      },
      {
        "zh": "“着”表示动作的持续状态",
        "en": "“着” indicating the continuous state of an action"
      },
      {
        "zh": "“会”表示将来、可能",
        "en": "“会” indicating the future or possibility"
      }
    ]
